      "content": "but resting doesn't work. i close my eyes and the thoughts are still there, loud as ever. even when i'm alone, the world just won't shut up. it feels like there's no actual way to get real peace. like, is there even such a thing as true silence? because i feel like i'll never find it as long as i'm here.",
